Association EdFi.StudentEducationOrganizationAssociation additions
    common Multiliteracy
        documentation "Indicates if the student received a multiliteracy award."
        is optional collection
    enumeration EdFi.SchoolYear
         documentation "The identifier for the school year associated with the Calendar."
        is optional
    shared string PriorId 
        documentation "A unique prior alphanumeric code assigned to a student."
        is optional collection
    common extension EdFi.Address
        documentation "Collection of address characteristics"
        is optional collection